{
  "id": "shafts_torsion",
  "title": "Shafts Torsion",
  "description": "Calculator for shear stress, angular deflection, and diameter of solid and hollow circular shafts subjected to torsion",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Shear Stress in Circular Shafts\n\nWhen a shaft is subjected to torque, shearing stress is produced. The shear stress varies from zero at the axis to maximum at the outer surface.\n\n**Formula:** τ = T × r / J\n\nWhere:\n- τ = shear stress (Pa)\n- T = twisting moment (Nm)\n- r = distance from center (m)\n- J = Polar Moment of Inertia (m⁴)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Solid Circular Shaft - Shear Stress"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "torque_solid",
          "label": "Torque (T)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter_solid",
          "label": "Diameter (D)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "shear_stress_solid",
          "label": "Maximum Shear Stress",
          "formula": "(inputs.torque_solid * (inputs.diameter_solid / 2)) / (3.14159 * Math.pow(inputs.diameter_solid, 4) / 32)",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "shear_stress_solid_mpa",
          "label": "Maximum Shear Stress",
          "formula": "((inputs.torque_solid * (inputs.diameter_solid / 2)) / (3.14159 * Math.pow(inputs.diameter_solid, 4) / 32)) / 1000000",
          "unit": "MPa",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Hollow Circular Shaft - Shear Stress"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "torque_hollow",
          "label": "Torque (T)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "outer_diameter",
          "label": "Outer Diameter (D)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        },
        {
          "id": "inner_diameter",
          "label": "Inner Diameter (d)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.03
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "shear_stress_hollow",
          "label": "Maximum Shear Stress",
          "formula": "(inputs.torque_hollow * (inputs.outer_diameter / 2)) / (3.14159 * (Math.pow(inputs.outer_diameter, 4) - Math.pow(inputs.inner_diameter, 4)) / 32)",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "shear_stress_hollow_mpa",
          "label": "Maximum Shear Stress",
          "formula": "((inputs.torque_hollow * (inputs.outer_diameter / 2)) / (3.14159 * (Math.pow(inputs.outer_diameter, 4) - Math.pow(inputs.inner_diameter, 4)) / 32)) / 1000000",
          "unit": "MPa",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Torsional Deflection of Shaft\n\nThe angular deflection of a shaft under torsion:\n\n**Solid Shaft:** α = 32 L T / (G π D⁴)\n\n**Hollow Shaft:** α = 32 L T / (G π (D⁴ - d⁴))\n\nWhere:\n- α = angular deflection (radians)\n- L = length of shaft (m)\n- G = Shear Modulus of Rigidity (Pa)\n- D = outer diameter (m)\n- d = inner diameter (m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Solid Circular Shaft - Angular Deflection"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "length_solid_def",
          "label": "Length (L)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "torque_solid_def",
          "label": "Torque (T)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter_solid_def",
          "label": "Diameter (D)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        },
        {
          "id": "shear_modulus_solid",
          "label": "Shear Modulus (G)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "defaultValue": 79000000000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "deflection_radians_solid",
          "label": "Angular Deflection",
          "formula": "(inputs.length_solid_def * inputs.torque_solid_def) / ((3.14159 * Math.pow(inputs.diameter_solid_def, 4) / 32) * inputs.shear_modulus_solid)",
          "unit": "radians",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "deflection_degrees_solid",
          "label": "Angular Deflection",
          "formula": "((inputs.length_solid_def * inputs.torque_solid_def) / ((3.14159 * Math.pow(inputs.diameter_solid_def, 4) / 32) * inputs.shear_modulus_solid)) * (180 / 3.14159)",
          "unit": "degrees",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Hollow Circular Shaft - Angular Deflection"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "length_hollow_def",
          "label": "Length (L)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "torque_hollow_def",
          "label": "Torque (T)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "outer_diameter_def",
          "label": "Outer Diameter (D)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        },
        {
          "id": "inner_diameter_def",
          "label": "Inner Diameter (d)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.03
        },
        {
          "id": "shear_modulus_hollow",
          "label": "Shear Modulus (G)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "defaultValue": 79000000000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "deflection_radians_hollow",
          "label": "Angular Deflection",
          "formula": "(inputs.length_hollow_def * inputs.torque_hollow_def) / ((3.14159 * (Math.pow(inputs.outer_diameter_def, 4) - Math.pow(inputs.inner_diameter_def, 4)) / 32) * inputs.shear_modulus_hollow)",
          "unit": "radians",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "deflection_degrees_hollow",
          "label": "Angular Deflection",
          "formula": "((inputs.length_hollow_def * inputs.torque_hollow_def) / ((3.14159 * (Math.pow(inputs.outer_diameter_def, 4) - Math.pow(inputs.inner_diameter_def, 4)) / 32) * inputs.shear_modulus_hollow)) * (180 / 3.14159)",
          "unit": "degrees",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Polar Moment of Inertia\n\nMeasure of shaft's ability to resist torsion:\n\n**Solid Shaft:** J = π D⁴ / 32\n\n**Hollow Shaft:** J = π (D⁴ - d⁴) / 32\n\nWhere:\n- D = outer diameter (m)\n- d = inner diameter (m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Polar Moment of Inertia Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "shaft_type",
          "label": "Shaft Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Solid",
              "value": "solid"
            },
            {
              "label": "Hollow",
              "value": "hollow"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "solid"
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter_j",
          "label": "Outer Diameter (D)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.05
        },
        {
          "id": "inner_diameter_j",
          "label": "Inner Diameter (d)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0.03
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "polar_moment",
          "label": "Polar Moment of Inertia",
          "formula": "inputs.shaft_type === 'solid' ? (3.14159 * Math.pow(inputs.diameter_j, 4) / 32) : (3.14159 * (Math.pow(inputs.diameter_j, 4) - Math.pow(inputs.inner_diameter_j, 4)) / 32)",
          "unit": "m⁴",
          "format": "scientific"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}